  <text>
    <body>
      <p source="#source-514-561"><seg source="#source-514-520">こは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-520-541"><rb>悪夢</rb><rt>あくむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-541-561">、あゝ神よ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-561-599"><seg source="#source-561-599">夢はふたたび見せざれな、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-599-637"><seg source="#source-599-637">われには斯かる嫉み無し。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-637-764"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-637-652"><rb>貴</rb><rt>あて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-652-655">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-655-741"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-3-1-91-26" source="#source-655-729">﨟</g></rb><rt>らふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-741-764">たきをみなごは</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-764-799"><seg source="#source-764-799">あまたの人に思はれよ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-799-834"><seg source="#source-799-834">かく思ひ、わかるゝ日、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-834-872"><seg source="#source-834-872">笑みやはらかに、君が手を</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-872-911"><seg source="#source-872-884">握りつゝ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-884-899"><rb>拝</rb><rt>はい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-899-911">しけり。</seg></p>
    </body>
